{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.MolecularBondBindingFromTrefoilInsertion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.MolecularBondBindingFromTrefoilInsertion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.bondEnergy_n_scaling","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.bondEnergy_n_scaling","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/molecular-bond-binding-from-trefoil-insertion.lean#L38-L45","doc":"Multiple-bond `n`-scaling: if every per-channel shift scales by a\ncommon factor `n` (`ΔΦ ↦ n·ΔΦ`), the bond energy scales by `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.bondEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.bondEnergy","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/molecular-bond-binding-from-trefoil-insertion.lean#L31-L36","doc":"The molecular bond binding energy as the Wedderburn-channel sum\nof per-channel volume shifts `ΔΦ` weighted by `W`, times the\nHartree scale `Emol`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:molecular-bond-binding-from-trefoil-insertion","label":"prop:molecular-bond-binding-from-trefoil-insertion","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/molecular-bond-binding-from-trefoil-insertion.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}